0.5d0                         ;maximum update in log cycles

1.d-6                         ;convergence tolerance (global system)



'solver settings'

0                             ;incomplete factorization level

50                           ;max. number of solver iterations

0                             ;solver information level

1.d-7                         ;solver residual tolerance

